      <!-- Points (suel_sp_uebertragungsleitungen_planningmeasure_point.sld,
           mt1/cl3, the only point rule): a #ffed00 WESP glyph 81 (a filled
           circle, per the SPM documentation's glyph table) of size 15. Its
           second, grey #828282 glyph 58 of size 10 is a block arrow: only
           its head is drawn (below). Lines (..._planningmeasure_line.sld,
           mt4): a #0066cc line of width 4, round joins and caps, plus the
           repeated glyph 101 X (below). -->
