      <!-- Facilities (suel_sp_uebertragungsleitungen_facility_multipoint.sld): the
           WESP glyphs 48 (ring, normal network) and 47 (disc, strategic network)
           carry a lightning bolt, glyph 101 is the X of a removal. Redrawn with
           circles only: a ring is a colored circle with a white one inside, a disc
           a colored circle, a removal gets a red dot in place of the X. A circle
           mixed with another shape would be written as an SVG image, which
           MapServer refuses to load, so the bolt and the X are left out. -->
      <Color ili:tid="210"><!-- #4daf4a -->
        <Name>suel_anlage_green</Name>
        <L>63.9421</L>
        <C>64.9563</C>
